      "text": "⬻ (auditory, concentrate, emotion, linguistic, mental); Frequency once per round Effect The bosun orders an ally to attack or to get in position. Until the end of the ally's next turn, they gain the bosun's choice of a +2 status bonus to attack rolls or a +10-foot status bonus to their Speeds."
